# Kontrak API MVP

Base path: `/api/v1`. Endpoint selain `/health` menerima `Authorization: Bearer <Supabase access token>`.

| Method | Endpoint | Fungsi | Status MVP |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| GET | `/health` | Health check Render | tersedia |
| GET | `/cases` | Daftar kasus milik user | tersedia |
| POST | `/cases` | Membuat kasus | tersedia |
| GET | `/cases/{id}` | Detail kasus | lanjutan |
| DELETE | `/cases/{id}` | Hapus kasus dan bukti terkait | lanjutan |
| POST | `/cases/{id}/evidence` | Upload bukti | lanjutan |
| GET | `/evidence/{id}` | Metadata/status bukti | lanjutan |
| DELETE | `/evidence/{id}` | Hapus bukti | lanjutan |
| POST | `/evidence/{id}/analysis` | Mulai proses ML | lanjutan |
| GET | `/evidence/{id}/analysis` | Ambil hasil ML | lanjutan |
| GET | `/safe-locations` | Daftar lokasi bantuan/aman | lanjutan |

Register, login, logout, dan forgot password dilakukan melalui Supabase Auth di frontend, bukan endpoint backend buatan sendiri.
